      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont even know who i am anymore. like im looking in the mirror and it doesnt feel like me. it just feels like i'm watching a stranger go through the motions. everything is getting so blurry and quiet. it's like the \"me\" part of my brain is just... evaporating. i feel so empty and disconnected from everything. it's terrifying but also kind of makes me feel like there’s no point to any of this.",
